{"id":"vod_sn_37334","vodId":"37334","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"推理之绊","name_cn":"推理之绊","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/5724cc1547853ea1ca24f1d0ab8b82f5.jpg"},"summary":"月臣学院高等部一年级的鸣海步（铃村健一 配音）拥有着极高的智商和缜密的推理能力，但即使是这样，小时候的他也一直都生活在哥哥鸣海清（井上和彦 配音）的阴影里。令他意想不到的是，两年前的某天，哥哥留下了“诅咒之子”的讯息后神秘失踪了。对于哥哥的失踪，鸣海步一直都耿耿于怀，他既想得知一直敬仰的哥哥的下落，又想弄清楚哥哥一直痴迷于研究的所谓的“诅咒之子”和“不为人知的真相”究竟是什么。鸣海步结识了学姐结崎雏乃（浅野真澄 配音），后者在校园中的巨大情报网络为鸣海步的追踪提供了便利。随着调查的发展，一个足以颠覆鸣海步的世界的真相渐渐地浮出了水面。　　动画片改编自漫画家城平京的同名漫画，该作因其轻松的校园风格和严谨的推理在读者中积累了巨大的人气。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:51:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/avXY5ciAeh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2gnMHmnwBv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DjJ2YAmH2f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZVHSRWMZEf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q6gu7rbAsb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PSw8i32khC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1BuSJxiQXD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1wuTZJa3aE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dg515qhXRB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9349JMWaG21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qFrBRqhatx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rNaxBShfZX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9fGPvWmR3e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hAvtSMFzi01/v